<h2>Written here</h2>
<p>All of <code>src/</code> (tokens, base, layout, components, utilities, <code>im.js</code>, and the syntax highlighter <code>im-code.js</code> with its colour theme — a tokeniser written for this system, not a port of an existing library), every partial in <code>partials/components/</code> and <code>partials/shell/</code>, everything in <code>sections/</code>, and the docs tooling in <code>site/</code> — class names, token names, markup structure, file layout and scripts included.</p>

